WEBVTT

00:04:28.195 --> 00:04:30.249
I sat back on my bunk

00:04:30.249 --> 00:04:32.268
and I reflected on something I had read

00:04:32.268 --> 00:04:34.865
in [Plato],

00:04:34.865 --> 00:04:36.840
where Socrates stated in "Apology"

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:41.111
that the unexamined life isn't worth living.

00:04:41.111 --> 00:04:46.943
At that point is when the transformation began.

00:04:46.943 --> 00:04:49.863
But it didn't come easy.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.764
One of the things I realized,

00:04:53.764 --> 00:04:55.921
which was part of the transformation,

00:04:55.921 --> 00:04:59.663
was that there were four key things.

00:04:59.663 --> 00:05:01.970
The first thing was,